<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('../../partials/head') %></head>
<body class="flex overflow-hidden bg-zinc-50" style="height:100vh;font-family:'Sofia Sans',sans-serif">

  <%- include('../../partials/adminSidebar', { currentPage: 'content' }) %>

  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">

    <div class="bg-white border-b border-zinc-200 px-8 py-5 shrink-0">
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 m-0">Entries</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 mb-0">Browse and moderate all platform entries</p>
    </div>

    <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8 flex items-start justify-center">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-md border border-zinc-200 p-12 max-w-md w-full text-center mt-8">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <iconify-icon icon="lucide:image" width="24" style="color:#2563eb;display:block"></iconify-icon>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-500 mb-4">Phase 6</span>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-800 mt-0 mb-2">Entries Moderation</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Browse every entry submitted to the platform with search and filter controls. Take moderation actions on individual entries.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-zinc-500 text-left flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#d4d4d8;display:block"></iconify-icon>Search by username, caption, or tags</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#d4d4d8;display:block"></iconify-icon>Filter by media type (photo / video)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#d4d4d8;display:block"></iconify-icon>Entry detail with rating history and contest participation</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#d4d4d8;display:block"></iconify-icon>Hide or remove entries from the platform</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </main>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
